      "text": "The polynomial for which $a$, $b$, and $c$ are roots is $(x-a)(x-b)(x-c)$. \\begin{align*}\n(x-a)(x-b)(x-c) &= (x^{2}-(a+b+c) + ab - ac - bc ) (x)\\\\\n&= x^{3}-(a+b+c)x^{2} + (ab + (-c)(-ac) + (-b)(-bc))x - abc\n\\end{align*}Rearranging equation 2 based on the coefficient formula gives us $a+b+c=-3$ and $abc=11$, $t=-4a-4b-4c=2t.$ \\boxed{2t}",
